            "notes": "You will be surprised how lenient [Maces to Faces](item_072c4780-53a1-4abd-9fc9-32406c3b7b49)'s radius increase is. Very good item to keep inspire uptime high. \n\nIn case you haven't played this hero much... stay back and whip people from afar. Don't play Brig like you're a tank, you're much more fragile than you think. Just do what you can to keep your passive heals up as much as possible while still staying safe and healing your team through packs when needed. Don't use your shield bash as a \"going in\" ability, it's your escape tool.",
