            "notes": "[Chain Extender](item_0a0d50dc-0ec9-42f6-a0ad-c373eb44dc6d) is great, it lets us play safe from far back and still keep inspire up pretty consistently.\n\nThe other option here is to minmax AP items to get about 40% right away... but I find taking [Chain Extender](item_0a0d50dc-0ec9-42f6-a0ad-c373eb44dc6d) more fun.\n\n### To Note: \nIf something is marked IMPORTANT, don't replace it with the optional items unless it says something about it in the round notes. Otherwise, swapping between the recommended and optional items is fair game.",
