        {
            "id": "bc01f6e9-d33a-46f6-b026-bdbf1a476a5f",
            "build_id": "f8cc4b67-b8f3-4db4-b373-9fbad54580f1",
            "round_number": 7,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-08-27T22:57:20.664755+00:00",
            "notes": "### Powers\nUsually, pick whichever between [God Ray](item_4abb5cdb-f113-4f21-aa0a-e67d95a11fd0) and [Sk\u00f6ldkastning](item_a6c36dee-d961-428b-b27c-93ba5ef377d8) that you haven't taken yet. \n\nOr, if you want more healing uptime through your packs, [Packstacker](item_87b99cde-3089-42fd-86bc-6e1ebf3fe422) works well with this build too. \n\nHowever... the weird third option is [Lindholm Wall](item_a733a6f5-72cd-43cd-a0fd-b1e03fa34753) combined with the item [Hardlight Weave](item_0e674b2f-4048-4fc9-be6d-95d51d2ae33b). Why? Well, you end up with a decent-size shield that has about 1200 hp. It can help you save your team, and is not longer paper-thin. (Though, if they have melee builds or other heroes that can just pierce through the barrier, probably not worth taking) This can be surprisingly useful, especially if you're struggling with your survivability, though [Hardlight Weave](item_0e674b2f-4048-4fc9-be6d-95d51d2ae33b) doesn't have any AP added to it, so it's more situational. \n\n### Items\nOther than [Hardlight Weave](item_0e674b2f-4048-4fc9-be6d-95d51d2ae33b), which you only take if you pick [Lindholm Wall](item_a733a6f5-72cd-43cd-a0fd-b1e03fa34753), there are three (or four, I guess) options for your final item slot this round:\n- [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e): Big chunk of AP and good CDR, and a little extra power for your ult, which you should be getting pretty quickly. These are all great things for you\n- [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce): The pure AP option. Good for bigger healing and damage output. Costs a fair bit, though. \n- [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8): A good option, gives you both decent AP while adding to your survivability, especially with the amount of cooldowns Brig has.\n- [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6): The \"I'm low on cash :(\" option. 20% AP is still decent, though.",
